  <body>
    <sec><title>Introduction</title>
      <p>Low oxygen changes how liver cells process messenger RNA.</p>
    </sec>
    <sec><title>Results</title>
      <p>Across three donors, the splice ratio fell by 40 percent within six hours of hypoxia onset, and it recovered
      after <italic>reoxygenation</italic> for 24 hours.</p>
      <p>No change was seen in the control exon.</p>
    </sec>
